  "body": "**What fails:** `cargo test -p xtask catalog_seed_links_face_pocket_and_drill` on `main` at `6ffa808ae` and later:\n`committed metadata and links check: \"operations/operations-2d.md: example links missing or stale; run cargo xtask catalog\"`.\nSeen by M5 main-health (Linux), m3 and bacon.\n\n**Cause:** the merge of PR #2714 (Slot Undercut) added a `## Slot Undercut` section to `site/content/guide/operations/operations-2d.md` without the generated `<!-- catalog:examples:start -->` ... `end` block that `catalog::links::sync` expects for every operation kind. The last green main before it was `8a6c6921b`.\n\n**Fix:** add the generated block (`cargo xtask catalog`). Its docs output is exactly 6 lines under `## Slot Undercut` (\"No catalog case yet.\"). The run also rebuilds every catalog `.camproj`; those changes are not part of this fix.\n\nDone means: the xtask catalog tests pass on main.\n",
